; the keyboard shortcut caps show on every tier, as in the app, through Kbd showOnTouch.","Every visible string is bound with $i18n except identities (Widget ids, feature tags, shortcut keys); en-US and zh-TW keep identical key sets.","Visual language follows the Quiet Canvas design system in DESIGN.md."],"decisions":[],"entryConditions":["A member pressed ⌘K, or pressed the search field of the top bar, on a Workbench page; the palette opens centered near the top, 768px wide, with the field focused and the first row active.","The base state is the Overview of a Workspace with Views, Flows and threads, for a member who may create Checkpoints: the list starts at its top (Go to) and the other groups are below it, reached by scrolling.","The Canvas group, and the two canvas comment actions, are offered only while a View page is open; Create Checkpoint is offered on a desktop and a tablet layout, never on a phone.","The render context selects one Workspace viewport preset, one Locale and one theme; the palette is Workbench chrome and follows the Workbench language, so its text is baked here per Locale."],"intent":"Show the command palette of the Workbench (open with ⌘K or the search field of the top bar, from every page) as built from Adapter Widgets only: a search field over one scrolling list of groups (Go to, Views, UX Flows, Threads, Canvas and Actions), each row with an icon, its label, an optional muted note and its keyboard shortcut.","interactionRules":["Typing filters every group at once and drops the groups with no match; with no match at all the list says so instead of staying empty.","A row that cannot be used is listed disabled with the reason beside it, never just missing: commenting without the key reviews.write, Comment on Workspace in a read-only session, Create Checkpoint without checkpoints.create.","Go to lists each navigation destination and Workspace page, the Catalog included, which opens the Catalog block of the Product Kit page; Views, UX Flows and Threads are found by name, a Review thread by its Widget id, \"Whole View\" or \"Workspace comment\" with the View and status beside it.","A row carries its shortcut when it has one (G then O for Overview, V, I and ⇧1 on the canvas, ⌘. for the theme); Enter or a click runs the active row and closes the palette."],"references":[{"label":"Phase 5 of the closed loop: dogfood coverage of the core surfaces","relation":"decision","type":"external","uri":"https://github.com/DevilTea/uiux/discussions/379#discussioncomment-19257377"}],"requirements":["01a116f0-8c67-70e5-885b-d7b7f28feafb"]},"variants":{"actions-blocked":{"requirements":["01a11544-540d-765c-8552-d1f3a4d0ef10","01a11a5e-0c71-78d1-9adb-14db6c67ab9c"],"state":{"act-checkpoint":{"dimmed":true},"act-checkpoint-suffix":{"visible":true},"act-comment-view":{"dimmed":true,"visible":true},"act-comment-view-suffix":{"visible":true},"act-comment-workspace":{"dimmed":true},"act-comment-workspace-suffix":{"visible":true},"act-toggle-comment":{"dimmed":true,"visible":true},"act-toggle-comment-suffix":{"visible":true},"group-actions":{"visible":true},"group-canvas":{"visible":false},"group-flows":{"visible":false},"group-goto":{"visible":false},"group-threads":{"visible":false},"group-views":{"visible":false}}},"canvas-and-actions":{"requirements":["01a116f0-8c67-70e5-885b-d7b7f28feafb"],"state":{"act-comment-view":{"visible":true},"act-toggle-comment":{"visible":true},"group-actions":{"visible":true},"group-canvas":{"visible":true},"group-flows":{"visible":false},"group-goto":{"visible":false},"group-threads":{"visible":false},"group-views":{"visible":false}}},"goto-scrolled-to-end":{"requirements":["01a17443-8e49-7ae2-905c-e13b9dcdddca"],"state":{"group-actions":{"visible":false},"group-canvas":{"visible":false},"group-flows":{"visible":false},"group-goto":{"visible":true},"group-threads":{"visible":false},"group-views":{"visible":false},"nav-flows":{"visible":false},"nav-overview":{"selected":false,"visible":false},"na